en bring it back and  I and it could almost be a nostalgic  like oh they're doing that again  because otherwise I just watch and I'm  like what's gonna turn out to be the  mystery box What's the phrase  like right from episode one I'll be  listening all right what is it what's  the phrase that they're gonna keep  saying over and over again that I can  watch for  I don't want to sit there a doctor who  with a checklist  that's that's not how I want to approach  the show it should be grander Freer less  predictable  but those are my overall thoughts and my  issues and my gripes and my rantings  about the mystery box and its place in  Doctor Who  what do you think about this do you  think I gave a fair and accurate  breakdown to the structure as a whole  how it's been used in Doctor Who up to  this point what are your thoughts about  it do you like it do you like some more  than others what are your favorite  instances what ones do you think didn't  work whatever any of your thoughts are  drop something down in the comments  let's talk about it  patreon's what pays the bills are around  here there's also a link down in the  description any amount that you can  assist with is really really helpful  it's what allows me to do this as my job  and keep making content at this pace and  at this quality for all of you folks to  enjoy but even if you're not able to do  that like shares And subscribe those  help me out a great deal as well  but what I really want you to remember  especially during the holidays  is that you are beautiful  you are valid  you are loved  you are the council I'm just running the  meetings and until next time this  Council is adjourned  Merry Christmas  [Music]  end of the video so I got a shout out my  top patrons Robin Moore Zubin mcfula  Tarak the thing that goes doing in the  anime Oliver B Angus bjarnasen Melinda  Walters imudelki the oatha Boyd catoria  toy lowly Becky Sparks for nabilox the  poodle Zach Tracy scrabot angry Casper  Tim price Ada